r=\"1\" width=\"829\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Board of Secondary Education, Madhya Pradesh</strong><br>\n</span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>MPBSE MP Board Class 10th HSC &amp; 12th HSSC Result 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>MP Board Results 2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> </b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th HSC Result Available :<b> 15/04/2026</b></li>\n<li>Class 12th HSSC Result Available :<strong>15/04/2026</strong></li>\n<li>MPBSE 10th &amp; 12th Result Time :<strong>11 AM</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Exam Conducted By</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Board of Secondary Education, Madhya Pradesh, MPBSE Bhopal Are Conducted the High School Class 10th HSC &amp; Intermediate Class 12th HSSC Examination 2026.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>In this year 2026 around 16 Lakhs + are registered in <span style=\"color: #000000;\"></span>10th High School Class 10 Exam &amp; 12th Intermediate Examination 2026.</li>\n<li>This year Madhya Pradesh Board <strong>Class 10th</strong> Exam was held from <strong>13 February 2026 to 06 March 2026</strong></li>\n<li>This year Madhya Pradesh Board <strong>Class 12th</strong> Exam was held from <strong>10 February 2026 to 07 March 2026</strong></li>\n<li>This year the result of MP Board High School Class 10 &amp; Class 12 examination will be released <strong>15 April 2026 at 11 AM.<br>\n</strong></li>\n<li>What documents / details will be required to check the result of MP Board class 10 exam &amp; 12th Exam&nbsp; this year.</li>\n<li>To check the mp result of Annual Board Examination 2026, the candidate will need the roll number.</li>\n<li>Candidates who do not have roll number available or not known can check it in their admit card or can check from their school/college/board.</li>\n<li>MP Board Class 10 HSC &amp; 12th HSSC Result of all stream Result will be released<strong> 15/04/2026 </strong>together.</li>\n<li>Candidates can also check their subject wise result of the exam.</li>\n<li>Stream Wise Toppers information will also be released by the MPBSE Results 2026.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>MPBSE Result 2026 MPBSE :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Results Last Years Details</span><br>\n</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MP Board 10th Exam 2026 Result <strong>Percentage Available Soon </strong>Candidate Passed, In the year 2026<br>\nMP Board 12th Exam 2026 Result <strong>Percentage Available Soon </strong>Candidate Passed, In the year 2026</li>\n<li>MP Board 10th Exam 2025 Result 63.23% Candidate Passed, In the year 2025<br>\nMP Board 12th Exam 2025 Result 55.28 % Candidate Passed, In the year 2025</li>\n<li>MP Board 10th Exam 2024 Result 58.10% Candidate Passed, In the year 2024<br>\nMP Board 12th Exam 2024 Result 64.49% Candidate Passed, In the year 2024</li>\n<li>MP Board 10th Exam 2023 Result 63.29% Candidate Passed, In the year 2023 the result</li>\n<li>MP Board 12th Exam 2023 Result 55.28 % Candidate Passed, In the year 2023 the result</li>\n<li>MP Board 10th Result 2021, a total of 9,14,079 students had appeared in MPBSE class 10 and the percentage of the result was 100% percent.</li>\n<li>MP Board 12th Result 2021, a total of 6,60,682 students had appeared in MPBSE class 12 and the percentage of the result was 100% percent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"319\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Second Exam Class 10th</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"MP Board Class 10th Result\" href=\"https://result.mponline.gov.in/Result/ResultSecondExam?rspbmhsh=MgfgfJHGFFtytytykoReiLme7klyzA1kUfdsfdsfDDSFDSFDsdai4eyrZZGnPzi9K1pc7sKI0vs==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Second Exam Class 12th&nbsp;</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"MP Board Class 12th Result\" href=\"https://result.mponline.gov.in/Result/ResultSecondExam?rspbmhsh=MgfgfJHGFFtytytykoReiLme7klyzA1kUfdsfdsfDDSFDSFDsdai4eyrZZGnPzi9K1pc7sKI0vs==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Class 10th HSC Result<br>\n</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Check MP Results - MPBSE 10th Result 2026\" href=\"https://result.mponline.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Server I</b></a> | <a title=\"Check MP Results - MPBSE 10th Result 2026\" href=\"https://mpbse.mponline.gov.in/MPBSE/MPBSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Server II</b></a> | <a title=\"Check MP Results - MPBSE 10th Result 2026\" href=\"https://mpbse.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Server III</b></a>